WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Many of you probably heard the big news

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.440
about the Boy Scouts, this was a big story.

3
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.260
Last week the organization decided

4
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.560
to allow girls to join

5
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.760
and they officially changed their name to just Scouts.

6
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.469
Yeah.
(audience cheering)

7
00:00:12.469 --> 00:00:13.750
Cool.

8
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.583
Now of course.

9
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.880
Course a lot of people have opinions about this

10
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.530
and they're wondering if making the organization co-ed

11
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.290
is a good idea.

12
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.300
We haven't talked about it yet

13
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.543
what do you think Andy?

14
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.780
Well I don't want to swing anyone's opinion

15
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.900
but I did get my hands on some footage

16
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.073
from the co-ed Scout camp.

17
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.180
I think a lot of you will find it very troubling.

18
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.013
Take a look.

19
00:00:39.191 --> 00:00:40.024
(fire crackling)

20
00:00:40.024 --> 00:00:42.774
(dramatic music)

21
00:00:43.701 --> 00:00:44.618
What the.

22
00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:48.170
Which one of you did this?

23
00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:54.199
(audience laughing)

24
00:00:54.199 --> 00:00:55.032
Oops.

25
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.080
Hi I'm Andy Richter

26
00:00:57.080 --> 00:01:00.480
and I'm here to talk to you about implicit bias.

27
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.460
If you watched that clip

28
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.530
and assumed the owner of the curling iron would be a girl

29
00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.863
then you just showed implicit bias.

30
00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.093
Something to think about.

31
00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:12.330
Okay I think we got it.

32
00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.936
Let's give it up for my camera operator Sam.

33
00:01:14.936 --> 00:01:16.200
(applauding)

34
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.033
Thanks Andy.

35
00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.533
Hi me again.

36
00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:23.750
If you assumed my camera operator Sam was a man

37
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.470
you've once again shown implicit bias.

38
00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:28.863
Check your bias.

39
00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.660
Okay guys we're really done now.

40
00:01:31.660 --> 00:01:33.560
I have to take my car to the mechanic.

41
00:01:34.943 --> 00:01:35.920
Yes.

42
00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:40.220
My mechanic is a woman, damn it people this is exhausting.

43
00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:42.100
I'm spending the rest of my day

44
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.373
fighting against gender inequality.

45
00:01:45.373 --> 00:01:48.373
(audience cheering)

46
00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.460
Hi I'm Conan O'Brien

47
00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.670
and if you really thought Andy

48
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.890
was gonna spend the afternoon on activism

49
00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.370
instead of taking his usual nap,

50
00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.480
then you just showed implicit bias.

51
00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:03.630
Hi I'm Andy Richter

52
00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.510
and if you thought Conan wasn't going to be

53
00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:07.630
a grade A douche bag about this

54
00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.330
then you showed implicit bias.

55
00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.500
Hi I'm Conan O'Brien

56
00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.110
and if you thought Andy wasn't gonna get way too emotional

57
00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.960
and overreact to my teasing then you--

58
00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:18.847
Hi I'm Andy Richter

59
00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:20.850
and if you thought this sketch was better

60
00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:24.540
before Conan inserted himself into it then you--

61
00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.930
Hi I'm Conan O'Brien and I'm sorry

62
00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.770
but the last time I checked the show's called Conan.

63
00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.685
Hi I'm Conan O'Brien and oh damn it!

64
00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:33.924
(Conan laughing)

65
00:02:33.924 --> 00:02:35.090
Shut up!

66
00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.080
You're so sensitive.

67
00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.030
Because you're always undermining me!

68
00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.590
Hi I'm Tony Hale.

69
00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:44.130
And I'm here to promote the new season

70
00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.830
of Arrested Development available May 29th on Netflix.

71
00:02:47.969 --> 00:02:49.577
That's right, this whole thing

72
00:02:49.577 --> 00:02:51.650
was an elaborate marketing ploy.

73
00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.860
If you thought it was a comedy sketch (laughs)

74
00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.233
then you've just shown implicit bias.

75
00:02:58.556 --> 00:03:01.556
(audience cheering)

76
00:03:09.817 --> 00:03:12.817
I have no idea what just happened.

